; lantern_handheld.tres — ToolDefinition for the handheld lantern.
; max_durability = 0 signals "never wears out" (DOCS §3.4: "Lantern never wears out").
; lantern_light_radius_m = 8.0: OmniLight3D range wired in builder.tscn.
; light_cull_mask = 2 (CHANNEL_BUILDER_ONLY) per Pitfall 9 — does not suppress mob spawning.

